,{"text":"Exception identification"},{"text":"Compliance dashboards"},{"text":"Risk scoring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Process Automation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power Automate"},{"text":"Python automation"},{"text":"SQL-based reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This reduces repetitive compliance work and improves monitoring."},{"type":"h","text":"AI in Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory document review"},{"text":"Policy comparison"},{"text":"Transaction anomaly detection"},{"text":"Compliance monitoring"},{"text":"Document classification"},{"text":"Risk summarisation"},{"text":"Regulatory-change tracking"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, compliance decisions should remain human-reviewed and supported by authoritative regulatory requirements."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A compliance-focused pathway:"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Com Forensic Accounting/Auditing"},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Compliance Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Compliance Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Head of Compliance"},{"type":"h","text":"Chief Compliance Officer"},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative Forensic Route"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Com"},{"type":"h","text":"Forensic/Audit Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Forensic Accounting Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Forensic Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Forensic Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Forensic Director / Investigation Head"},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative Risk Route"},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Risk Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Risk Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Risk Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Enterprise Risk Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Chief Risk Officer"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Accounting"},{"type":"flow","items":["Financial Accounting","Corporate Accounting","Financial Statements"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Audit"},{"type":"flow","items":["Internal Audit","Internal Controls","Audit Testing"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance"},{"type":"flow","items":["KYC","AML","Regulatory Monitoring","Compliance Testing"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Forensics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Fraud Detection","Transaction Analysis","Investigation","Evidence Documentation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Advanced Excel","SQL","Power BI","Python"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Risk"},{"type":"flow","items":["Operational Risk","Fraud Risk","Compliance Risk"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"flow","items":["Regulatory Research","Report Writing","Documentation","Communication"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary Objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Accounting + business + statistics"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Audit + internal controls + compliance"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Forensic accounting + AML/KYC + analytics"}],[{"text":"Final Year"},{"text":"Compliance projects + internship + professional qualification preparation"}],[{"text":"0–2 Years"},{"text":"Compliance Associate / AML / Audit / Risk role"}],[{"text":"2–5 Years"},{"text":"Compliance Analyst / Senior Analyst / Specialist"}],[{"text":"5–10 Years"},{"text":"Compliance Manager / Risk Manager / Forensic Manager"}],[{"text":"10+ Years"},{"text":"Compliance Head / Risk Head / CCO / Forensic Director"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For this degree-to-career combination, the strongest route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Forensic Accounting/Auditing","Compliance/Audit Internship","Compliance Associate","Compliance/AML/Risk Specialist","Compliance Manager","Compliance Head/CCO"]},{"type":"p","text":"The key advantage of this degree is the combination of accounting + auditing + investigation + compliance. The student should avoid becoming limited to administrative compliance work and instead build expertise in internal controls, AML/KYC, fraud analytics, regulatory monitoring, and data-driven compliance. Adding Advanced Excel, SQL, Power BI and Python can create a strong bridge between traditional audit/compliance and modern RegTech, financial crime analytics, and risk management."}]}]}